# keep secrets out of the repo: your API key lives in an env var or an
# untracked file, never in a tracked one
.env
.env.*
.envrc
mise.local.toml
*.pem

# Claude Code's project directory is machine-local: settings in here can hold
# your course API key, and this repo goes public when you ship. Your tracked
# harness is CLAUDE.md (and any AGENTS.md), not this directory.
.claude/

# Raw downloaded third-party asset packs (spritesheets, ZIPs, license files)
# used as source material for public/sprites and public/audio. Only the small,
# cropped/recolored/renamed files actually shipped belong in the repo — see
# THIRD_PARTY_ASSETS.md. This folder is the local working copy, never committed.
assets/
